        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/ba8739/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2022-11-05T23:12:01.592Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Makes me consider watching <em>V for Vendetta</em> on HBO Max, but then I think about the trash talk Alan Moore was heaping on comic book movies recently and suddenly I’m not so keen on his work. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/confused.png?v=12\" title=\":confused:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":confused:\"></p>",
